  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bhutan Trade Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU-Bhutan Trade Support project aims to increase export diversification, possibly contributing to the implementation of the  &#x201C;Brand Bhutan&#x201D; initiative, by improving the capacities of trade and investment policy formulation and implementation, and increasing exports in selected value chains i.e. horticulture and textile handicrafts.</narrative>
  </description>
